 "remarks": "Super cool & fun living in the pulse of downtown Stamford is yours to have! Enjoy fab cityscape views from the super large entertainer's balcony (20 feet long!) in this immaculate & updated 7th floor condo in the heart of sophisticated downtown. Enjoy reserved parking, a bright new kitchen, drift-wood style laminate floors, separate sleeping alcove and living room with fabulous south-facing balcony overlooking downtown. HEAT AND HOT WATER INCLUDED IN RENT. There is a small, separate storage unit. Enjoy living the urban dream in vibrant downtown Stamford, steps to the renowned Avon Theater, popular restaurants, shops, bars, the Ferguson library and public transportation. 1-cat allowed.",
